`stage_d1_s2.py:885-899` defines a machine-checkable completeness scan: every WRITER row of the capability file that names a conditional terminal or a created constant must have all ops named on it present in A3's table, else gate `A3-complete` fails. The prediction contract at `:260-263` lists `A3-complete (nf)` among **15 PASS / 0 FAIL**.

